# 8. LARGE / DERIVED DATA
# Raw GDELT caches are never committed: they are re-downloadable from GDELT and
# from the project's GitHub Release. The SILVER snapshot in data/silver_seed IS
# committed — it is small, already filtered, and is what fills the silver volume
# at startup.
**/data/raw/mentions/*
**/data/raw/events/*
**/data/release/*

